{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_06_end","storyGroup":"act38side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act38side_level_act38side_06_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PV-6","storyName":"“复仇于我”","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"柳德米拉回到营地，得知索默尔尚未回来。心怀愧疚的她一路查到港口，发现了失踪的卡车与车厢内走私的武器。为了不让卡车互助会陷入更大的麻烦，柳德米拉点了一把火。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act38side/level_act38side_06_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act38side_06","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["卡车司机","法官助理","柳德米拉","索默尔","港口工人","调度员","粗嗓子","大嗓门","甜甜的声音"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_bg_56_g9_truckcamp.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"animtext","id":8,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月6日    3:20 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":9},{"type":"animtextclean","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"实在不好意思，助理先生，让您白跑一趟了。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"她没有告诉你们去哪里了？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"没有，但、但是请您转告拉维妮娅法官，伊雷妮有在认真调查她拜托的事情。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"伊雷妮刚回到营地，就让我们对互助会名下的卡车进行自查了，她这会儿出去应该也是为了找车祸的线索——","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"别紧张。我不是为这个事来的。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"啊？那——欸，柳德米拉，你知道伊雷妮去哪里了吗？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"回营地怎么还偷偷摸摸的，差点都没注意到你......","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"charslot","id":29},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"你衣服怎么还破了？和别人打架了？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"摔了一跤。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"你就是柳德米拉？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"我有东西要给你。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"本来是应该由伊雷妮统一处理的，她不在，直接交到你手里也正合适。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"这是？","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"市民告知函和身份文件。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"你通过了市政厅与法院的背景审查，你的市民积分也够了......","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"从今天起，你就是新沃尔西尼的合法市民、卡车工会的正式在籍司机了，享有《新都市管理法案》所规定的一切权益。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"哈哈，终于终于！","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"柳德米拉，你昨天那一顿盐汽水请早了！","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"很意外吗？我们知道你的——呃，特殊之处。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"你还是需要定期接受矿石病检查，如果感染情况恶化的话，我们会重新评估对你的处理方案。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"卡车工会在这座城市的地位很特殊，以你的情况，本来确实很难通过背景审查......","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"伊雷妮这段时间为这件事没少往市政厅和法院跑，最后她亲自为你做了风险担保，好些个司机都跟着在申请材料上签了字。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#4$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"哎呀，柳德米拉，别用这样的眼神看着我嘛。总不能让你平时白请我们吃东西喝东西吧。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"柳德米拉？","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"您别怪她，她一向话不多......我当时拿到告知函和身份文件的时候可比她失态多了。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"我能理解，根据资料显示，当初收养你的舅舅被卷入帮派斗争，全家都被灭门......其实大家都差不多......","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"新沃尔西尼建成之后，许许多多曾受到家族压迫的叙拉古人都赶来了这里，取得新的身份，摆脱家族的影响......","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"甚至有不少家族成员，也通过这种形式脱离了家族。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"在新沃尔西尼，我们每个人都拥有摆脱过去、拥抱新生活的权利。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"恭喜你，柳德米拉。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","id":77},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":79},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉看着手里的市民告知函和身份文件，沉默着。","id":80},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.4","fadetime":"2","id":81},{"type":"dialog","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":85},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":88},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":89},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_bg_56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"“不期而会”，我没什么文化，但我知道这是一个好词......你不觉得它就是在讲咱们这些人吗？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"all","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"就当是倒霉蛋们不期而会了吧，哈哈。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮那丫头总说，再倒霉的人也会被生活眷顾的，只是会迟一些。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"curtain","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":105},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"false","id":106},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_bg_56_g9_truckcamp.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":107},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"这就是对倒霉蛋的眷顾吗......","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"柳德米拉，你到底怎么了？","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"索默尔有没有回来？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"没有，他不是从昨晚开始到今天都休息嘛，可能去给小古莉挑狂欢节的礼物了吧。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"别替他打掩护了，鲁杰罗。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我知道你们的事情......我昨晚就在索默尔的车上。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"......","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":127,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"昨晚的那场车祸？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"嗯，是我们的车。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"天哪——","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......看你的反应，索默尔没回来。快想想他可能去哪儿了。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"他们昨晚应该原定在第三码头附近的载具检修站交货，我们有时候也会选威尼斯载具公司名下的几个废弃仓库......","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"都找遍了。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我回了撞车的地方，现场已经被封锁，索默尔和车都不知所终，我也去了你刚刚说的那些地方......都没有。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我怎么能就那么走掉呢，该死的，如果我没有被那个狼崽子吸引，说不定......","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"柳德米拉......","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我再去找！","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":147},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.7","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-500,0","duration":"1","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":150},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":154},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_bg_56_g11_newvolsiniipier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":155},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":156},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.7","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_craneworking","volume":"0.5","id":159},{"type":"animtext","id":160,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月7日    2:30 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":161},{"type":"animtextclean","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......只剩下这里了。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":167},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉站在集装箱之间，抬眼看向面前繁忙的港口。","id":168},{"type":"text","text":"整整一天过去了，她找了她能找的所有地方，但一无所获。","id":169},{"type":"text","text":"她可以在天灾肆虐的切尔诺伯格穿行，在混乱的战场带队准确锁定敌人，但她如今却找不到一个普普通通的卡车司机。","id":170},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉觉得有人跟自己开了一个玩笑，她突然有些无力。","id":171},{"type":"dialog","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"charslot","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"港口工人","text":"你是说，现在就把那些花车开走？","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"对啊，都已经组装完成了，全部运往拓展地块，那是狂欢节当晚巡游的起点。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"港口工人","text":"这我知道，我的意思是，不是本来安排在晚上吗？","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"你没看见刚刚那场暴雨吗，突如其来的。新沃尔西尼很少有这样的坏天气，鬼知道今天还会不会再下雨......","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"十几辆巨型花车，动起来那么大的阵仗，真要碰上刚刚那样的大雨，就得进行道路管控，会有很多不必要的麻烦。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"港口工人","text":"说得也是。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"趁着雨停了，尽快吧。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"对了，沿途会经过不少地方，记得给每辆花车都盖上篷布，市政厅的意思，巡游开始前，花车造型都得保持神秘。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"港口工人","text":"行，我去召集人手。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":195},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"250,0","duration":"1.5","id":197},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"如果索默尔只能原路返回，想要在这忙碌的港口藏起一辆车，难道说......","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-350,0","duration":"1.5","id":209},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"charslot","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"false","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"text","text":"新沃尔西尼港的一角，十几辆工程吊车撑起巨大的篷布，在露天处凭空创造出一个封闭的迷宫。","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"十几只造型奇特的巨大野兽沉寂在篷布之下，在狂欢节复活之前，这里就是它们的墓园。","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉就这么经过它们，她没有心情去研究这些怪家伙，她径直走到队伍的末尾，然后停了下来——","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"那是一只巨狼。它巨量的拟真皮毛覆盖住了身下卡车的车厢。尾巴刚好垂在了车厢那醒目的凹陷和划痕上。","id":218},{"type":"text","text":"巨狼张开血盆大口无声地向前方怒吼，所有不可告人的秘密都藏在它的身下。","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":223},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_trnpndor","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉拉开了货厢的门，眼前是堆满的黑色轮胎，以及......","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"charslot","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"这是......","id":229},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.4","fadetime":"2","id":230},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":232},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":235},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_bg_56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你帮威尼斯运的什么货？","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"今天晚上是一批轮胎。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"基本都是载具生产会用到的耗材，源石引擎、钢件、合金之类的，有时候也有一些冻鳞冻肉酒精药品......","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"这种事情在叙拉古的其他城市很常见，家族的商品基本都不走正常的报关程序，能避很大一笔税。只不过在新沃尔西尼——","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"charslot","id":247},{"type":"curtain","id":248},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_bg_56_g11_newvolsiniipier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":250},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉抽出匕首，沿着她刚刚看见的裂口，划开了厚实的轮胎表面，露出里面的东西。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"铳械、法杖、制式弩箭，甚至还有源石炸药......","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"索默尔，你真蠢啊，你知道自己在运的，是这样的“商品”吗？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"*乌萨斯粗口*，事情竟然比走私轮胎，误撞了代理市长还要复杂！等等，有人......","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"粗嗓子","text":"应该就是这里了。","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"粗嗓子","text":"甘比诺，你这边我那边，动作快一点。","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大嗓门","text":"卡彭，你有想过吗，要是真找到了，怎么向小威尼斯交代我们从哪儿得到的线索？","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大嗓门","text":"总不能说是拉普兰德告诉我们的吧？","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"粗嗓子","text":"我更关心的是，那个疯子是怎么知道索默尔把卡车藏在新沃尔西尼港的......","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"粗嗓子","text":"以及，她到底想干什么？","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大嗓门","text":"算了，想这些没有意义，干活吧——等等，外面好像有条子，避一避！","id":270},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":272},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"0.5","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甜甜的声音","text":"前辈，我是诺埃米。","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甜甜的声音","text":"前辈，你那边有什么发现了吗？","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甜甜的声音","text":"我从来不喝咖啡，好苦。","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甜甜的声音","text":"什么呀，前辈你别打岔了！我知道肇事车辆可能藏在哪儿了，你快点过来！","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甜甜的声音","text":"对，就在新沃尔西尼港的西边，停放花车的地方！","id":279},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_truckengine","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":281},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#4$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"等等，港口的人已经开始......","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉听见工程吊车的机械臂扯落篷布的声响，以及前方车辆陆续发动的声响。","id":289},{"type":"text","text":"家族的人和警察都在不远处，这辆花车、花车下的秘密、索默尔，还有那些卡车司机的“新生活”很快就将暴露在天光之下。","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"*乌萨斯粗口*！","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":294},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":295},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉的手拂过自己的身侧，她触摸到了一片湿润。那是一份折叠起来的文件，证明自己已经成为那些愚蠢的家伙的一员。","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"应该是刚刚跑来港口的时候被雨淋湿了，离开营地的时候，她甚至没来得及将它放回自己的帐篷。","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"深秋时节，又淋了一场雨，这会儿回过神来，还真是冷，柳德米拉心想。","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"要是能生堆火取暖就好了。","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"l","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":305},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_bg_iceforest_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":306},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":307,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"兄弟，看看雪地上的这堆篝火。曾经，它可以点燃感染者的愤怒，点燃整合运动的理想，烧遍整个乌萨斯。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3F/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"但是现在，它只够你和我取暖。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3F/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"charslot","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":314},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E4/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“先学会点火吧，烧掉这栋房子，和这里面的一切，让其他人再也找不到我们。”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":317},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“柳德米拉，火会隐藏一切。”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":318},{"type":"subtitle","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","id":320},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_burn","layer":"1","id":321},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firestorm","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"1","g":"0.6","b":"0.3","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E4/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.7","yScale":"1.7","fadetime":"0.5","id":324},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":327},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0.3","amount":"0","id":330},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_56_i03.png","fadetime":"1","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","screenadapt":"coverall","id":331},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"45","block":"false","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉站在不远处的阴影里，沉默地看着火焰从车厢燃起，爬升，很快吞没了整只巨狼。","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"火可以点燃愤怒，点燃理想，火也可以掩埋一切。","id":335},{"type":"text","text":"而自己的烟雾可以隐藏火焰。在其他人发现之前，她足以让火势扩大到无法被熄灭。","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"唉，真倒霉啊。","id":338},{"type":"dialog","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":340},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":341},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":342},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":343},{"type":"image","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345}],"characters":["卡车司机","法官助理","柳德米拉","索默尔","港口工人","调度员","粗嗓子","大嗓门","甜甜的声音"]}